                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-261_l8" HPOS="374" VPOS="965" WIDTH="1769" HEIGHT="65" BASELINE="376 1013 2143 1008" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="376 1013 376 1030 2141 1026 2143 1008 2139 978 1946 965 1944 965 1942 965 1916 978 1771 978 1756 965 1754 965 1752 965 1749 965 1747 965 1745 965 1732 976 1689 965 1687 965 1684 965 1682 965 1680 965 1663 976 1550 965 1548 965 1496 976 1448 965 1446 965 1444 965 1290 976 1273 965 1271 965 1269 965 1266 965 1264 965 1262 965 1243 978 1212 967 1210 967 1208 967 1206 967 1184 978 1123 967 1121 967 1119 967 1084 978 1026 967 1024 967 1022 967 998 978 935 967 933 967 931 967 905 978 859 967 857 967 855 967 803 978 744 967 742 967 740 967 710 978 649 967 647 967 374 974 376 1013"/>
                        </Shape>
